# twa.thaiwater.net anonymous x-api-key  (recorded 2026-09-04)
#
# NOT our credential and not a secret. HII ships this key in the public JS
# bundle at twa.thaiwater.net, in an axios request interceptor, to every
# visitor who is not logged in:
#
#   t ? headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${t}`
#     : headers["x-api-key"] ||= "<this key>"
#
# It authenticates the anonymous public role; /auth/get-public shows that role
# holds view on all 159 public datasets and nothing else. We cannot rotate it,
# and every endpoint returns 401 without it, so redacting it would make the
# survey and the puller non-reproducible - which is their whole point.
#
# Reclassify if it ever stops being served publicly by HII.
